The application of these efficiencies was done by weighting every term in the average of Equ. 3.10 by the inverse of that track's efficiency. Protons were weighted by \(1/\epsilon_{\rm TPC}\) while pions and kaons were weighted by \(1/(\epsilon_{\rm TPC}\times\epsilon_{\rm TOF})\).

