#### EPD Hit Selection

The selection for the hits in the EPD was also unchanged from the analysis at \(\sqrt{s_{\rm NN}}=3.0\) GeV in order to maintain consistency and accurate comparisons of results across datasets. Each tile's TnMIP value was used as its weight in the event planes from the EPD, with a threshold of 0.3 and a maximum of 2. Any tiles with an nMIP \(<0.3\) is set to 0 and anything above 2 is set back to 2.

